WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
This is the Watcher invitation, not an access confirmation.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
A browser return cannot tell us whether Whop completed your subscription or granted a trial.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sign in to the Whop account you used and check its library or receipt first.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.333
Once Whop confirms your membership, the room follows one being across twenty-eight days.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:21.333
The Realm introduces the being in the first week.

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:25.000
The Process shows how the vision was made in the second.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.667
The Records hold the story underneath the image in the third.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:31.667
These chapters are meant to be revisited, not rushed.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:35.000
Let each part give the next one room to arrive.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.423
In the fourth week, the Session is the place for a live gathering and questions, subject to the schedule in your Whop room.

00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:51.288
Your monthly choice starts with seven days free, then renews at twenty-eight dollars every twenty-eight days unless canceled under Whop's terms.

00:00:51.288 --> 00:00:52.964
The annual choice has separate terms.

00:00:52.964 --> 00:00:57.991
The seven-night return described here begins after a first payment, not on the first day of a trial.

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:00.225
Confirm all charges, dates and access in Whop.

00:01:00.225 --> 00:01:04.973
If your account does not show the membership, contact Numinous support with your receipt and checkout email.

00:01:04.973 --> 00:01:07.207
Do not send your password or card details.

00:01:07.207 --> 00:01:10.000
The verified library, not this return page, is the door.
